<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1276] job name for ParallelALSFactorizationJob is confusing</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1276</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;ParallelALSFactorizationJob set job name per each iteration in different with logger`s info. job name start from 2 and numIterations is 0 based. therefore if I run job with iteration 5, job names start from &quot;Recompute M, iteration (2/5)&quot;. It would be better if we set job name same as logger info message since current job name could be confusing.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12656817">MAHOUT-1276</key>
            <summary>job name for ParallelALSFactorizationJob is confusing</summary>
